# Writing Reports Skill

Use `skills/writing-reports-pandoc-gost/SKILL.md` for Russian GOST-style reports and strict DOCX/PDF outputs.

- For paired GUAP DOCX/PDF, read `skills/writing-reports-pandoc-gost/references/word-master.md`; prefer editable Word + separately filled cover + PDF export. Retain the pinned LaTeX route when explicitly required. Pandoc/Quarto are optional.
- Never invent credentials or source content.
- Classify cover-only, reference, complete-example, and source-data assets.
- Preserve source/build inputs and verify the output.

Defaults without stricter rules: A4, 30/15/20/20 mm margins (GOST 7.32–2017), Times New Roman 14 pt, 1.5 spacing, 1.25 cm first-line indent, justified body, hidden title-page number. Render and verify both PDF and DOCX.
